{"event": "token", "client_ms": 15906, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:29.367Z", "t_ms": 15851, "delta": "In Corrective Retrieval Augmented Generation (CRAG), retrieved documents are assessed using a dedicated"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 16064, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:29.532Z", "t_ms": 16016, "delta": ", lightweight retrieval evaluator—specifically a fine-tuned T5-large model (0.77B parameters)—rather than relying on"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 16185, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:29.652Z", "t_ms": 16136, "delta": " a large, expensive LLM [C4, C5]. \n\nThe evaluator pairs the input query with each retrieved"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 16376, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:29.843Z", "t_ms": 16327, "delta": " document individually to compute a continuous relevance score [C4, C5]. CRAG then applies an upper threshold and a lower threshold to these"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 16619, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:30.087Z", "t_ms": 16571, "delta": " scores to determine an overall judgment across three discrete action triggers [C2, C6]:\n\n* **Correct:** Trigger"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 16785, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:30.254Z", "t_ms": 16738, "delta": "ed when the confidence score of at least one retrieved document exceeds the upper threshold [C2]. Because reliable knowledge is present, CRAG accepts"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 16967, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:30.435Z", "t_ms": 16919, "delta": " the retrieval and refines the documents into fine-grained \"knowledge strips\" by filtering out irrelevant parts and recomposing relevant"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 17119, "data": {"request_id": "a213c1295ea9", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-27T19:27:30.586Z", "t_ms": 17070, "delta": " information [C2, C6, C9].\n* **Incorrect:** Triggered when the confidence scores of *all* retrieved"}}
